WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:52.741
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:53.011 --> 00:53.970
Chiara.

3
00:54.554 --> 00:55.889
What are you doing?

4
00:56.514 --> 00:57.682
And where are you going?

5
01:01.061 --> 01:02.604
Didn't I already tell you?

6
01:02.687 --> 01:03.730
I don't want this anymore!

7
01:05.523 --> 01:07.984
Then why are you forcing this on me?

8
01:10.820 --> 01:12.530
Isn't there a better way?

9
01:12.614 --> 01:16.576
You can't escape what's already been destined for you, my child.

10
01:22.540 --> 01:23.917
We have reason to believe

11
01:24.000 --> 01:26.961
that all this time, the Concordat has never stopped keeping an eye on you.

12
01:28.254 --> 01:30.215
Then we need to do everything we can to get her back.

13
01:32.133 --> 01:33.468
-It's not that easy? -You don't understand.

14
01:33.551 --> 01:34.969
You owe me.

15
01:35.053 --> 01:37.055
For all the sacrifices I've made. Now I'm coming to collect.

16
01:37.138 --> 01:40.642
The person who I love needs my help.

17
01:44.521 --> 01:46.064
-Whose could this be? -Someone from outside!

18
01:47.524 --> 01:48.483
Come on, let's find out.

19
01:50.860 --> 01:52.904
Ma'am. Sorry to bother you.

20
01:52.987 --> 01:54.489
We found a motorcycle outside.

21
01:54.572 --> 01:56.991
Looks like we may have an unauthorized visitor.

22
02:01.454 --> 02:03.998
Mom. I'm going to look for Dad.

23
02:04.082 --> 02:05.708
You just need to keep yourself safe.

24
02:06.417 --> 02:07.836
Mom, please just listen to me.

25
02:07.919 --> 02:10.380
I'll explain everything, okay?

26
02:14.551 --> 02:16.344
Captain Pepe, please go to my mom.

27
02:16.427 --> 02:18.638
-Please take care of her. -Okay, Mikoy.

28
02:18.721 --> 02:19.931
-We'll take care of it. -Thank you.

29
02:20.014 --> 02:21.558
Okay, we'll leave you now.

30
02:21.641 --> 02:23.226
Mikoy, is your dad Mario missing?

31
02:25.395 --> 02:26.563
You know him.

32
02:27.063 --> 02:28.273
Maybe he's just being proactive.

33
02:28.898 --> 02:30.608
He's looking for Chiara on his own.

34
02:32.360 --> 02:35.572
So your dad does have a highly effective habit after all.

35
02:39.868 --> 02:41.077
I have a hunch.

36
02:42.620 --> 02:44.539
-You do? -What hunch?

37
02:45.707 --> 02:47.542
I think Mario knows something.

38
02:48.126 --> 02:50.712
He may have seen something or followed someone.

39
03:17.155 --> 03:18.448
Mario?

40
03:19.741 --> 03:20.783
Rahmboy?

41
03:23.912 --> 03:24.954
-Rahmboy. -That's right.

42
03:25.038 --> 03:26.039
-Mario. -But why…?

43
03:30.710 --> 03:32.253
I'm just following orders.

44
03:35.298 --> 03:36.341
Rahmboy.

45
03:50.438 --> 03:52.023
Why didn't he tell me?

46
03:55.318 --> 03:56.903
That's what I'm worried about too.

47
03:57.946 --> 04:00.031
But he's trying to protect you, Mikoy.

48
04:00.657 --> 04:02.951
He's trying to be a good father to you.

49
04:05.703 --> 04:07.205
So what do we do now?

50
04:09.415 --> 04:11.918
Call Dara and check Mario's phone.

51
04:12.418 --> 04:14.420
Let's see if my hunch is right.

52
04:29.060 --> 04:31.020
Sean has been talking to someone suspicious.

53
04:33.314 --> 04:36.609
There's a new character in Chiara and Mikoy's lives.

54
04:44.033 --> 04:46.703
And now she's a runaway bride?

55
05:06.180 --> 05:08.599
We need to investigate this Vicky.

56
05:29.829 --> 05:30.830
Vicky?

57
05:33.916 --> 05:35.335
What does this mean?

58
05:37.754 --> 05:38.755
Rahmboy?

59
05:40.214 --> 05:41.299
What is this?

60
05:42.884 --> 05:45.178
Have you lost your touch, Isidro?

61
05:47.263 --> 05:50.183
Don't you realize the predicament you are in?

62
05:53.311 --> 05:55.396
You're the one who took Chiara.

63
05:56.105 --> 05:58.733
Technically, I didn't take her.

64
05:58.816 --> 06:00.443
She came with me willingly.

65
06:00.943 --> 06:03.529
What do you have on her that makes her obey you?

66
06:04.906 --> 06:08.242
Chiara came with me because she wanted to.

67
06:08.326 --> 06:11.370
She doesn't want to marry Mikoy anymore, your son.

68
06:11.454 --> 06:13.122
Is that so hard to understand?

69
06:13.790 --> 06:16.167
Maybe Mikoy did something to her.

70
06:16.250 --> 06:18.377
Or maybe Chiara finally realized

71
06:18.461 --> 06:22.131
that she doesn't really want the life in Albay.

72
06:23.966 --> 06:27.386
You clearly don't understand the concept of love.

73
06:28.805 --> 06:31.224
The love between those two isn't that shallow.

74
06:32.809 --> 06:34.227
I don't think so either.

75
06:34.852 --> 06:37.480
There's someone more suitable for Chiara,

76
06:37.563 --> 06:39.398
and it's not Mikoy.

77
06:44.529 --> 06:47.698
And who gave you the right to choose for Chiara?

78
06:47.782 --> 06:49.200
She has parents.

79
06:49.283 --> 06:50.701
Viktor and Donabel.

80
06:55.164 --> 06:58.167
Being a mother isn't about blood.

81
06:59.710 --> 07:02.463
I'm the one who raised her. I'm the one who sacrificed.

82
07:02.547 --> 07:03.881
So I have every right.

83
07:06.050 --> 07:07.218
Besides,

84
07:09.303 --> 07:10.513
you're the reason

85
07:10.596 --> 07:13.224
why I lost my family.

86
07:14.225 --> 07:15.768
Spare me the lecture,

87
07:16.269 --> 07:18.938
Mr. Butuan Executioner.

88
07:25.611 --> 07:28.072
You've been enjoying your role a little too much

89
07:28.156 --> 07:29.490
as a family man.

90
07:30.074 --> 07:33.870
You've forgotten what you did when you were still an executioner.

91
07:39.959 --> 07:42.378
My family lived a quiet life.

92
07:42.879 --> 07:44.172
A simple life.

93
07:44.755 --> 07:46.132
Simple dreams.

94
07:47.091 --> 07:48.759
Simple joys.

95
07:50.470 --> 07:52.513
But because we were poor,

96
07:53.473 --> 07:57.393
we were mercilessly victimized by those in power.

97
08:03.107 --> 08:05.234
That's why I swore to myself

98
08:05.318 --> 08:08.446
that I would make anyone who oppressed us pay.

99
08:09.197 --> 08:10.573
And your group was one of them.

100
08:11.157 --> 08:12.366
Isidro Catacutan.

101
08:14.076 --> 08:16.162
The man who ruined my life.

102
08:17.330 --> 08:19.582
Revenge isn't easy.

103
08:21.501 --> 08:23.794
Seeking justice isn't easy either.

104
08:36.390 --> 08:40.978
You need power to make everyone feel

105
08:41.687 --> 08:45.650
how painful it is to have a mother's heart shattered.

106
08:51.239 --> 08:52.698
I promise you,

107
08:53.950 --> 08:56.619
I'll make whoever did this to you pay.

108
09:18.224 --> 09:20.685
That was an operation created to liberate the people

109
09:20.768 --> 09:22.103
of Sitio Bungkal.

110
09:27.650 --> 09:31.112
An authorized operation, yet my family got caught in it.

111
09:31.696 --> 09:33.739
Was killing them authorized too?

112
09:34.532 --> 09:36.117
They were innocent.

113
09:37.577 --> 09:41.163
The very people who are supposed to protect the innocent

114
09:41.247 --> 09:43.416
are often the ones who kill them.

115
09:44.917 --> 09:46.586
Is that what you swore to do?

116
09:52.508 --> 09:54.260
I fought the case.

117
09:54.760 --> 09:56.762
I went everywhere.

118
10:00.933 --> 10:02.602
Isidro Catacutan.

119
10:03.894 --> 10:06.272
The Butuan Executioner.

120
10:08.399 --> 10:11.611
But then I found out that you were supposedly dead.

121
10:13.863 --> 10:17.742
I thought that weeds don't die so easily.

122
10:25.124 --> 10:26.917
But what could I do?

123
10:27.001 --> 10:28.127
You were supposedly dead.

124
10:28.669 --> 10:32.423
So instead of seeking justice,

125
10:32.506 --> 10:35.217
I went abroad.

126
10:36.385 --> 10:38.095
Little did I know you were just here.

127
10:38.179 --> 10:39.597
Alive and well.

128
10:39.680 --> 10:42.141
With a family. Happy.

129
10:42.892 --> 10:47.480
While I had to settle for loving people who weren't even related to me.

130
10:54.320 --> 10:55.571
Vicky.

131
10:57.073 --> 10:59.241
I know that no matter what I say,

132
11:00.576 --> 11:03.496
it won't lessen the pain you're feeling right now.

133
11:08.250 --> 11:09.502
I'm a parent too.

134
11:12.338 --> 11:14.340
One wrong

135
11:15.841 --> 11:17.385
doesn't make another wrong right.

136
11:18.886 --> 11:23.224
You have no right to tell me what's right and wrong.

137
11:23.307 --> 11:25.226
You killed my family.

138
11:25.309 --> 11:26.977
So you should die too.

139
12:12.314 --> 12:14.150
Dara said that they already found Sir Mario's location,

140
12:14.233 --> 12:15.818
and they will send coordinates.

141
12:21.574 --> 12:24.285
Hello? Mikoy. Sorry, it took a while,

142
12:24.368 --> 12:26.287
but they were able to trace Sir Mario's location.

143
12:53.731 --> 12:55.357
I'm going to do what's right.

144
13:02.364 --> 13:03.616
What are you doing here?

145
13:04.909 --> 13:07.495
Do you hold a grudge against me?

146
13:07.578 --> 13:08.662
No, Uncle Mario.

147
13:08.746 --> 13:11.999
I just owe her a debt of gratitude, that's why I follow her.

148
13:14.919 --> 13:17.046
But I can't bear to see you die.

149
13:17.671 --> 13:19.340
You and Aunt Tess have been good to me,

150
13:19.423 --> 13:21.300
so I'm here to help you.

151
13:23.511 --> 13:24.678
Thank you.

152
13:27.181 --> 13:28.265
Mario.

153
13:28.349 --> 13:29.850
The car keys.

154
13:31.852 --> 13:34.855
Go through the back. I'm sure no one's guarding it.

155
13:35.981 --> 13:36.982
Thank you.

156
13:37.691 --> 13:38.692
Aren't you coming with me?

157
13:38.776 --> 13:40.736
I still have something to do here.

158
13:40.819 --> 13:42.863
I need to take Chiara with me.

159
13:45.115 --> 13:46.450
That's what I won't allow.

160
13:46.534 --> 13:49.495
Mario, leave now before I change my mind.

161
14:15.479 --> 14:16.772
Chiara!

162
14:17.356 --> 14:19.358
-Chiara! -What happened?

163
14:19.441 --> 14:21.318
Rio has already sent someone to kill you.

164
14:21.402 --> 14:22.778
You have to obey him now!

165
14:24.905 --> 14:27.324
There isn't much. There are only a few of them.

166
14:27.992 --> 14:29.368
Kill Rio.

167
14:29.451 --> 14:31.579
So you and Mikoy can finally be free.

168
14:35.916 --> 14:37.501
I'll take care of him.

169
16:35.160 --> 16:36.787
Who sent you?!

170
16:40.040 --> 16:41.542
Dad Mario.

171
16:57.391 --> 16:58.600
Dad Mario!

172
16:58.684 --> 17:00.227
Dad…

173
17:01.979 --> 17:03.522
-Dad Mario. -Chiara.

174
17:03.605 --> 17:05.607
This shouldn't have happened to Dad Mario.

175
17:05.691 --> 17:06.859
I'll get help.

176
17:06.942 --> 17:08.235
-Listen to me. -No.

177
17:08.318 --> 17:09.486
No.

178
17:09.570 --> 17:11.155
Hang on, Dad Mario!

179
17:11.238 --> 17:13.490
I'll fix this. I'll get help.

180
18:01.371 --> 18:03.082
My prayers have been answered.

181
18:04.792 --> 18:06.794
Heaven is on my side.

182
18:16.720 --> 18:17.971
You've lost.

183
19:07.354 --> 19:09.690
Looks like we're getting close to Dad Mario.

184
19:09.773 --> 19:11.233
But the tracker stopped.

185
19:14.111 --> 19:16.029
So that means Chiara is here too,

186
19:16.113 --> 19:17.489
if he managed to find her.

187
19:17.573 --> 19:21.910
And if his tracker suddenly stopped,

188
19:21.994 --> 19:24.496
then this place must have a signal jammer.

189
19:29.334 --> 19:31.461
I've already contacted the local authorities.

190
19:31.545 --> 19:34.089
I'll just give them the specific coordinates.

191
20:03.702 --> 20:04.578
No.

192
20:06.288 --> 20:07.664
You lost.

193
20:10.334 --> 20:13.086
You haven't won at love yet.

194
21:12.271 --> 21:13.814
Dad Mario, I'm here.

195
21:14.439 --> 21:15.524
Dad Mario.

196
21:17.567 --> 21:18.860
Dad Mario.

197
21:23.532 --> 21:27.160
No, I'm right here, Dad Mario.

198
21:27.244 --> 21:28.620
Dad Mario.

199
21:29.246 --> 21:30.872
Daddy Mario!

200
21:38.297 --> 21:40.841
I didn't mean to. I didn't mean to.

201
21:52.602 --> 21:54.062
I didn't know.

202
21:54.146 --> 21:56.189
I didn't know.

203
22:36.605 --> 22:37.773
We need you here.

204
22:37.856 --> 22:39.649
You need to come here.

205
22:45.405 --> 22:46.615
Let's go.

206
23:52.597 --> 23:53.598
Dad.

207
23:58.937 --> 23:59.896
Dad.

208
24:04.901 --> 24:05.777
Dad.

209
24:08.613 --> 24:09.614
Dad.

210
24:11.616 --> 24:12.701
Dad, why?

211
24:15.162 --> 24:16.121
Dad.

212
24:18.623 --> 24:19.666
Dad.

213
24:21.376 --> 24:22.460
Dad!

214
24:27.507 --> 24:28.758
Dad…

215
24:34.264 --> 24:35.265
Dad…

216
24:40.812 --> 24:41.646
Dad!

217
24:49.321 --> 24:50.363
Dad.

218
24:50.447 --> 24:51.531
Dad.

219
24:51.615 --> 24:52.532
Dad.

220
24:54.618 --> 24:55.702
Dad!

221
24:59.456 --> 25:00.332
Dad…

222
25:02.792 --> 25:04.211
I'm sorry, Dad.

223
25:05.712 --> 25:06.963
I'm sorry.

224
25:48.129 --> 25:49.839
This is my promise to you, Dad.

225
25:49.923 --> 25:52.259
I will make those people pay.

226
25:54.010 --> 25:57.514
The Concordat keeps getting away from us.

227
25:57.597 --> 25:59.599
Does this agency even serve a purpose anymore?

228
25:59.683 --> 26:03.311
You might forgot, they killed Mario Pinagpala,

229
26:03.395 --> 26:04.646
the father of Mikoy!

230
26:09.734 --> 26:12.112
I have to accept the fact that I'm a Valtrovi.

231
26:12.195 --> 26:15.198
I will die as a true Mafia.

232
26:18.118 --> 26:21.079
I will send him to where his father is now.

233
26:24.541 --> 26:26.251
Don't we have connections in Prague?

234
26:26.334 --> 26:27.919
Well, yes, but…

235
26:28.003 --> 26:31.006
with the chance of them helping us with Chiara's case,

236
26:31.089 --> 26:32.465
I doubt it very much.

237
26:32.549 --> 26:34.634
It doesn't matter if you can do something about it or not.

238
26:34.718 --> 26:37.846
I made a promise that I will make those people pay.

239
26:37.929 --> 26:38.847
And, that's exactly what I'm going to do.
